        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cheow Lan Lake is actually a man-made reservoir. It generates renewable hydroelectric power, provides water for irrigation and supports local fisheries. Today, it is also one of Thailand's most spectacular travel destinations.
