        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>When Is the Best Time to Visit?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok National Park can be visited throughout the year, and every season offers something different. There isn't a single "best" time to visit. The ideal season depends on the experiences you're looking for.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The dry months generally offer easier hiking conditions and more comfortable sightseeing. During the rainy season, the rainforest becomes even more vibrant, waterfalls are at their most impressive and river activities become more adventurous. Short tropical downpours are common, but they rarely last all day.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Rather than avoiding the rainy season, many visitors discover that it offers one of the most rewarding times to experience Khao Sok. The forest is at its greenest, the rivers are full of life and the National Park feels wonderfully alive.
        </p>
        <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/70 shadow-md">
          <table width="100%"><colgroup><col /><col /></colgroup><thead style="background-color: #577810;"><tr><th align="left">Season <button class="swipe-arrow" type="button" aria-label="Show the next table column">➜</button></th><th align="left">What to Expect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">November – February</td><td align="left">Generally cooler and drier, with lower humidity and more comfortable daytime conditions.</td></tr><tr><td align="left">March – May</td><td align="left">Hotter weather, strong sunshine and occasional heavy showers as the rainy season approaches.</td></tr><tr><td align="left">June – October</td><td align="left">Frequent tropical rain, lush rainforest, fuller waterfalls and faster river conditions.</td></tr></tbody></table>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Did you know?</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Rain is one of the reasons Khao Sok exists. The abundant rainfall supports one of the world's oldest evergreen rainforests, keeping the rivers, waterfalls and forests alive throughout the year.
        </p>
