        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>The Creation of Cheow Lan Lake</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          In 1987, the completion of Rajjaprabha Dam across the Pasaeng River transformed another part of Khao Sok forever. The rising water created Cheow Lan Lake, flooding the valley to form today’s spectacular landscape of limestone islands and sheltered bays.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The reservoir provides hydroelectric power, flood control, irrigation for agriculture and productive fisheries, while also supporting one of Thailand's most distinctive tourism destinations. The project required the careful relocation of five villages before the valley was flooded. Many of the families adapted to new ways of life, and today their descendants continue to play an important role in the communities and tourism that surround Cheow Lan Lake.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cheow Lan Lake is one of the defining features of Khao Sok National Park, attracting visitors from around the world while continuing to support both local communities and conservation.
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Did you know?</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          More than a thousand years before paved roads reached Khao Sok, this area formed part of an important overland trade route linking China and India. Rivers and jungle trails were the highways of their day, carrying traders and local communities through the rainforest for centuries. Today’s bamboo rafting experiences are based on these traditional methods of river travel, offering a glimpse into how people once journeyed through the forest.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Ready to Explore Khao Sok?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
